      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUMPING GEM (1) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for two wins and two minors. Below best last time at this track (23.66) in a Grade 5, finishing a 7 length fourth. Has the ability and should feature. MASTER LEHIGH (5) lines up here off a comfortable win at Dubbo after jumping from box 7 (18.46). Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. CHEEKY EDGE (3) is progressing well with another good run, placing by 6 lengths (18.71) in a Grade 5 at this track. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Expected to be in the finish again. KERT KERT (2) is worth a look despite no experience at this circuit.",
